# Single-page app fallback for Cloudflare Pages.
# Real files (assets, sitemap.xml, feed.xml, llms.txt, robots.txt) are served
# normally; any other path is handed to the router.
#
# Host-level rules cannot live here: Cloudflare Pages matches only paths in this
# file, never hostnames. Any legacy-domain 301 is handled by
# `functions/_middleware.ts`, driven by `legacyHosts` in `site.config.json`.
/*    /index.html    200